From: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 09:16:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: mfd: syscon: Add the T7001 i2s-switch

The A8X i2s-switch (Apple's i2s-switch,t7001) is the S8000 routing
block (AppleAE2I2SSwitch3) at its own address; the MCA driver programs
it as a syscon.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/syscon.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/syscon.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/syscon.yaml
index c74985051..6ce14ebaf 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/syscon.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/syscon.yaml
@@ -47,6 +47,7 @@ properties:
               - apm,xgene-rb
               - apm,xgene-scu
               - apple,s8000-i2s-switch
+              - apple,t7001-i2s-switch
               - apple,t8010-aop-i2s-oe
               - apple,t8010-aop-i2s-switch
               - apple,t8010-i2s-switch
-- 
2.56.0

